= A program, set by the address of the slide

A C++ program in raw OpenGL 3.3, compiled to WebAssembly, shown by `demo::`.

* The address gives its settings: `?speed=0.2&tilt=25`
* One build, a preset per slide
* Click in it: the arrows still go to the next slide

